# The local Docker trial, the development loop, and any setup where another
# proxy terminates the request in front of this Caddy. No TLS, and one site on
# a port; with no host name in the address, that one block answers for
# handout.localhost and for every <address>.handout.localhost under it, which
# is what the application needs to hand out addresses that resolve.
#
# The address comes from CADDY_SITE_ADDRESS: compose.yaml's env files set it to
# :80, behind the published 8080, and a proxy in front of this Caddy hands it
# its own port the same way.
{$CADDY_SITE_ADDRESS} {
	import handout-app
}
